  "context": "## JubAp.Net Frontier Operations Role in the IMSV.org Circle\nThe research and publication policy separates custody, authorship and assessment status. Record what an institutional receiver can retain, explain and make available, with the relevant rights and limits. A public contribution, an adopted method and an independently evaluated result remain separate states.\n\nThe architectural-continuity account suggests a valuable role for the circle: retain what an operating problem taught even when it is not ready for commercial generalisation. The field question is what survives the transition from a particular team and client setting into a reusable body of knowledge. Some elements may become a framework; others may remain a bounded case or an unresolved research question. That selective process preserves intellectual continuity without implying common ownership, universal usefulness or validation by association.\nEtiquetas: Empresa y gestión 18.18%; Evidencia, procedencia y atribución 18.18%; Memoria, comunidad y territorio 18.18%; Transformación y continuidad operativa 45.46%\nFicha: https://dakleyer.github.io/perspective-beyond/sources/jubap-net-frontier-operations-role-in-the-imsv-org-circle-n1441/\nDocumento de origen: https://jubap.net/jubap-net-role-in-imsv-org-frontier-engineering-and-operations-circle/\n\n",
